    "notes": [
      "'The first enemy crossing it' is translated the same way Reach Counter translates 'entering the Contested band': the first hostile attack on a party member standing in the warded band. No hostile in this engine ever moves bands.",
      "triggerRawDamage and triggerDamageLevelScale are held equal to battle.rs by reach_counter_and_ward_line_deal_their_authored_damage. A separate number from Reach Counter's because the two reactions cost differently: one is free and unlimited, this one costs a whole turn to place and is spent after one hit.",
